Introducing: Lattices ✨





 
Your designs just got a new dimension.
With Lattices, you can add intricate patterns to any object in your scene and make your 3D prints lighter, stronger, and smarter.



Full creative control
 




🌐 7 new lattice patterns to bring into your objects
 
✳️ Fine-tune your output with controls for scale, thickness, and repetitions



Print Smarter
 



 
Beyond aesthetics, lattices power your prints - lighter, stronger, and cheaper. Less material, more performance. Perfect for both
prototypes and final parts.
 

Try now [https://beta.womp.com/]





